== Top goalscorers ==
The ''[[Capocannoniere]]'' (top scorer) of 2005–06 was [[Luca Toni]] of [[ACF Fiorentina|Fiorentina]]. His 31 goals was the highest tally since [[Antonio Valentín Angelillo]] scored 33 for [[Inter Milan]] in [[1958–59 Serie A|1958–59]].

